                        <div class="tl-title" data-i18n="Core Platform Built">Core Platform Built</div>
                        <div class="tl-text" data-i18n="Course management, exams, assignments, and multi-role dashboards launched.">Course management, exams, assignments, and multi-role dashboards launched.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tl-item">
                        <div class="tl-dot" style="background:#F48C06;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #F48C06;"></div>
